  status: done
  title: "Time tracker CLI"
  quote: "Build a time tracker CLI in Python. Subcommands: start <project>, stop, log, report. Persist sessions in a JSON file, refuse to start a session while another is active, detect overlapping sessions, show durations formatted as HH:MM:SS, and report total time per project. Single file time_tracker.py, stdlib only."
  steps:
    - {do: "Spec written and linted", check: "cmd: PYTHONPATH=.forgemyspec/harness python3 -m forgemyspec lint forgemyspec-bundle/time-tracker/spec.yaml --formal"}
    - {do: "User approved the spec", ok: true}
    - {do: "Implement time_tracker.py and tests", check: "cmd: python3 -m unittest discover -s tests -t ."}
    - {do: "Gate passes", check: "cmd: PYTHONPATH=.forgemyspec/harness python3 -m forgemyspec gate forgemyspec-bundle/time-tracker"}
  evidence: "gate RESULT: PASS, 7 boundary tests"
